OL,3,GNEWSAWhat happens after plans for a new
OL,4,Atown are dropped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe small Cheshire village of Adlington
OL,7,F- home to only about 1,200 people -
OL,8,Ffound itself making national news in
OL,9,Frecent months.
OL,11,FIt had been put forward as a site for a
OL,12,Fpotential new town of up to 10,000
OL,13,Fhomes, sparking protests and calls for
OL,14,Fpolitical resignations.
OL,16,FBut after the proposals were ultimately
OL,17,Fnot taken forward by the government,
OL,18,Fthe site's owner is now looking to
OL,19,Fbuild 1,275 new homes.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
